wait 34
cam hold
wait 13000
set time 12 0
shot huts-north
wait 700
shot huts-north-b
wait 300

# hole: the hole in the roof of HAFEN04 from 30 m above the west quay, looking down into its mouth: the throat of the plume that the ridge hides from huts-north
